        <Param val="Part #1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will learn word matches in this first part.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;First, you will see a target word at the top of the screen, with two possible matches below it. Your job is to guess which word matches the top word. You will then get feedback about the accuracy of your choice and will try to remember the correct word match based on that feedback. In the last round, you can earn a cash bonus for each word you remember correctly.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For example: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;ABSTRACT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;1) DOG&amp;#10;&amp;#10;2) PLATE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;To guess Option 1 – press the '1' key.&amp;#10;To guess Option 2 – press the '2' key.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
